Soldier's weapon choice code seems to be seriously broken - they won't
ever use firearms if they are in melee range or have any grenades
left. It looks like you never tried to take advantage of firearms.  A
pair of assault rifles can make double-wielding Mojo and GS seem as
underpowered as a rusty mace.  You need to be clever to keep them from
blowing up all their own bullets with grenade explosions, however.

Also, note that Captains will use rocket launchers, which hit VERY
hard.

>  * Lawful Quest: Just silly, but fun silly. Doesn't belong in Vanilla but
>    a fine slash'em addition.

Lawful quest can give you guaranteed sources of MR and reflection, an
amulet of flying (who needs levitation?), and you can use the Spice
girls to boost your intelligence (what a concept! - NHINRL)

>  * Neutral Quest: Just easy. Also the Eye of the Beholder is useless.

Not useless, just difficult to use effectively - invoking the Eye on
some levels can do tens of thousands of HP of damage.

>  * Chaotic Quest: I stuck my nose in. Too many summoners!!! So I genocided
>    most of them and came back. Vecna takes damage from +0 Magicbane, is that
>    a feature?

Yes, it's a feature.  But you should have gone up to the weapon's shop
and paid to enchant MB to +2 - the extra damage would have been worth
it.

